styled_effects — the GIMP receipts here predate the #2 stroke seed.

source.psd and manifest.json are regenerated by core/tests/psd_export_corpus.rs
(DR_PSD_10B_FIXTURES). #2 changed the Layer Style Outside Stroke's distance
seed to 1 - c/255 (core/src/style_stroke_distance.rs); the "Styled" layer is
anti-aliased (its checker has alpha 130 pixels), so its outside stroke, and with
it the composite preview and the manifest's "render", moved.

  source.psd sha256 before #2: 8a13c151ae2dd9de107f487ddf058bee42ab5c52f630593e56c6983b3d625a08
  source.psd sha256 after  #2: b5f8ca73bff623fcd9b74ef06d475850a0812c816391433d23392cf2bc5e5f00

gimp.json, reopened.png/.icc and merged.png/.icc are GIMP 3.2.6's reopening of
the BEFORE file (gimp.json's source_psd_sha256 names it). They were not re-taken:
GIMP is not run in this batch. Until scripts/verify_phase10b_external.py is
re-run against the current source.psd, these receipts describe the earlier
bytes. The layer records, layer effects (lfx2), mask and blending options the
case qualifies are unchanged: of the manifest, only "render" differs (94
pixels, at most 147 codes), and in source.psd the composite preview drawn from it.

#2's byte Fill (core/src/opacity_byte.rs) composites the "Styled" layer's
Fill of 0.5 at Photoshop's 128/255, so the manifest's "render" moved again (3
samples, 1 code each) and with it the composite preview; the layer records,
the lfx2 effects and the iOpa byte (128) are unchanged.

  source.psd sha256 after the byte Fill: be35360c6f28ada9c8ee8a9f8fb2a1c4203245dc68c197bd2a21678d099082bd

#2's soft Drop Shadow member (core/src/style_matte.rs, style_fx_drop_shadow's
MATTE: sigma size * (1 - spread) / 2.5 instead of / 2) narrows the "Styled"
layer's size-4 shadow, so the manifest's "render" moved again (358 samples in
168 pixels, at most 4 codes) and with it the composite preview; the layer
records, the lfx2 effects and the iOpa byte are unchanged. The offset rule
(the distance-5, angle-120 shadow's +2.5 half, rounded away from zero) did not
change.

  source.psd sha256 after the soft shadow member: e8fb866cd7210a540658aac09ab2a158c66d5237db03735a09fa5e6a208eabd9
